# Unreleased

- Migrated from the archived `gopkg.in/src-d/go-git.v4` to the maintained
  `github.com/go-git/go-git/v5`, resolving CVE-2023-49568, CVE-2023-49569,
  CVE-2025-21613, and CVE-2025-21614 (no fix was available in v4).
- BREAKING (SSH git push): go-git v5 verifies the remote SSH host key against
  known_hosts by default; v4 did not. If you use `GitPush` over SSH, add the
  remote host to `~/.ssh/known_hosts` (or point `SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS` at a hosts
  file). To keep the previous behavior and skip host-key verification, set
  `GitVerifyHostKey = false` in the `[main]` section of contra.conf.

# v1.0.0

- Initial stable release with functional collection and tracking.